{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2025-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1757980800, "end_date": 1758671999, "month_true_total": 221, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:02:00 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "205055871", "author": {"steamid": "76561199201451258", "personaname": "情思", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199201451258/", "num_games_owned": 119, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 18472, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15099, "last_played": 1773789871, "avatar": "d7b7988e7bc32f8e08ab167acd110bf8783e59af"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "很喜欢的一款游戏，在我的steam喜爱游戏中能排进前十，虽然时长不多，但这游戏让我体验到了很多乐趣。刚接触时的手忙脚乱到和朋友的互相伤害。玩法也是多样的，不同的任务，不同的武器，不同的职业，不同的搭配等等。肝度自然也是有的，升级，做任务，解锁更高难度，挖矿攒材料来锻造模组来强化自身等等。这也是我第一款肯花钱买衣服的游戏。希望能一直玩下去吧", "timestamp_created": 1758660045, "timestamp_updated": 1758660045, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205054874", "author": {"steamid": "76561199001473964", "personaname": ".", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199001473964/", "num_games_owned": 80, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1052, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1052, "last_played": 1674662482, "avatar": "fd1a2ac3513cb9f595650d2202a181aee9102d59"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "没朋友就不会打开的游戏，后期有点单调，初体验还可以", "timestamp_created": 1758659079, "timestamp_updated": 1758659079, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "prim